lady nimue walks the avalon marsh after dark. [the wizards chasing their epic know her by sight|ask any wizard who did their epic]
[saw|spotted] lady nimue in [camelot hills|campacorentin] once, [just walking|walking like she owned the place]. [she never looked at me|i didn't dare say hello]
a friend of mine conned lady nimue once. the color alone told him to walk away. leave her be
they say the lady of the lake kept [the blade|excalibur] after arthur, which is why [we only have the scabbard|the scabbard is all we got]
lady nimue keeps the same road every day. snowdonia by day, the marsh by night. like she's looking for something

