[the|those] afanc hatchlings mean [there's a mother|the big one is still breeding]. [think about that next swim|keep your feet dry]
the legendary afanc hasn't left the lake since arthur's day. can you blame it
there's a hoof print stone up by llyn barfog. some say arthur's horse still haunts it

@who Explorer
[swam|went] across llyn barfog [once|at dusk] and [something|a ripple] [followed me|went under me]. [never swam there again|i ran]

