# ---------------- Xanxicar and the Crystal Cave ----------------
@who *
@levels 30-50
a two-headed dragon called xanxicar sleeps in the crystal cave under avalon. [wait too long|dawdle] and the cave fills with lightning
[i think|my theory is] xanxicar was [guarding|sitting under] avalon [long before|before] the drakoran came. [maybe that's why it stayed hidden|it was the lock]
heard the lightning timer in the crystal cave got longer. still not long enough

