# ---------------- Caer Sidi and the road to Annwn ----------------
@who *
@levels 30-50
caer sidi [sits on|straddles] the road to annwn. [the souls in there|whatever is in there] [aren't meant to leave|stay locked up]
the old poem says arthur sailed to caer sidi with three ships and only seven men came home. bards still sing it
the cwn annwn are arawn's hounds. if you hear them baying, run
heard you never wear anything shiny into caer sidi. the dead go for the gilded first
caer sidi is a prison of souls, and something at the bottom keeps the count. i don't want to meet it

