# ---------------- The drakoran, the inconnu and Arawn ----------------
@who *
@levels 20-50
the drakoran burned avalon city to rubble, and someone held their leash
arawn sent the inconnu because [someone|a witch] is stealing his dead. [strange allies|odd friends], eyes like wells
the arawnites in [snowdonia|the black mountains] [pray to|serve] the same lord the inconnu [serve|answer to]. [explain that one|so whose side is arawn on]
i've never heard an inconnu laugh. not once
the drakoran aren't stupid beasts. they have mystics, medics and sawbones. that's an army
dura'ek the empowered leads the drakoran in avalon city, they say. empowered by whom is the question

