@levels *
our relics are merlin's staff and excalibur's scabbard. lose either and the bards sing about it for a month
[the scabbard|excalibur's scabbard] was always worth more than the blade. [the old tales say|merlin said so himself] [it kept arthur from bleeding|its wearer never bleeds]
the heralds promised more relics years ago. still waiting
the missing relic is excalibur itself. find the blade and you'll [find avalon too|know where avalon is]. [my theory anyway|just a theory]
merlin's staff sits at castle myrddin in snowdonia. funny how merlin never came back for it

@who NoLifer
